    [main] Cherry pick PR 4586 (#4594)
    
    ## What changed
    
    Cherry-picks PR #4586 onto `main`.
    
    This brings over the live log streaming fixes from `2.8`, including:
    - re-registering `JobLogReceiver` for server-job subprocesses
    - preserving the startup retry tolerance in `LogStreamer`
    - routing system-injected job log streaming to the server parent
    - renaming `SystemLogStreamer` to `SiteLogStreamer`
    
    ## Why
    
    PR #4586 fixed the integration-test failure where live log chunks could
    arrive before the server-job process had registered stream processing
    for `log_streaming:live_log`, causing `no stream processing info
    registered` and tearing down the stream.
    
    ## Validation
    
    ```text
    ~/nvflare-env/3.12/bin/python -m pytest -v \
